[2m│[0m [1m[38;5;231mSection 3 look right, and what should happen to buffered records when the log endpoint is unreachable?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mDrop after one retry (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mStateless logger, nothing sensitive at rest on user devices. Loses records generated during the outage window.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Persist to sessionStorage, resend later
     [38;5;246mSurvives failed flushes and crashes, at the cost of diagnostic records sitting readable on the user's machine.[39m
